    s_MELATONIN_TEXT(py_str("Melatonin is a short-term sleep aid rather than a knock-out: 1 to 2 mg about an hour before bed shifts your body clock, so it suits jet lag or a bedtime that has drifted late, and it works best with a dark room and the same wake-up time. Ask a pharmacist first if you take blood thinners, epilepsy drugs or antidepressants. If sleep has been poor for weeks, see your GP - it is not a long-term fix."));
